  },
  {
    tier: 'Freelance and stringer work',
    detail: 'Per-story rates that vary enormously by outlet and beat, often a few hundred to a few thousand rupees a story at smaller publications, with no guaranteed monthly floor. This is the most common way into the field, and the least predictable financially.',
  },
  {
    tier: '2-4 years, beat reporter',
